      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("You monsters there! Halt! This is the sovereign realm of Wesmere. No further may you go."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Monsters?! For spewing such hurtful venom, the true monster is you, Vonel! We must look deeper than their hideous and odious exteriors. Look deep to the beauty within!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            id: "Salennea",
            x: "31, 28, 27, 17",
            y: "17, 18, 18, 23",
            raw: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("Princess, I beg of you, walk not again into jeopardy!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Be silent, Vonel. For I am no mere “princess” awaiting your salvation; I am a Lady of Wesmere!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("<small>(_<small><i>you will always be a princess to me...</i></small>)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Your beastly sinews and steel tools of death do not impress me, Vonel, for my witful tongue and virtuous conscience are more than protection enough in any case I may find myself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("<small>(_<i>... Shek’kahan, thisss is elves’ sssoft underbelly I ssspoke of... </i>)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("These creatures of yours ramble incomprehensibly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("<small>(_<i>That is jussst what they do. Now I will further pacify them with praise—</i>)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Wise Salennea! We wish entry to your land to ssseek your counsssel. Grant usss thisssss, Salennea the Jussst!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Ah, “Salennea the Just”. I shall weave this into the long twine of my existing titles... “Wise Lady Salennea, the Just, Wielder of the Sapphire of Ice, the Embracer of Woses, the Merciful to Orcs, Keeper of Ca—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Salennea! ... we grow weary of travel... and we go hungry! <b>So Hungry.</b>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Salennea, pray allow usss entry."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("Nay! This is a March of Wesmere, we shall not..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Marches only part us, Vonel. Let all be welcome to Wesmere!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            id: "Salennea",
            x: "27, 28, 31, 31",
            y: "18, 18, 17, 14",
            raw: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("This is my castle Saethrania — the Castle of Virtue. You may make an abode of castle Gliinoler — the Castle of Sacrifice. My attendants will bestow whatever form of floral nourishment you most desire. Mayhap Bread of the Locust Fruit softened with Milk of the Hazel and sweetened with Sap of the Birch?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Also, there are some little things I must ask of you... As I do realize your off-putting rough and scaly skin is largely beyond your control, I ask only that you dress well enough to cover as much of yourselves as you feel comfortable doing. I wish that you take no offense in my asking this favor! Further, I find your odors somewhat repulsive— Though I shan’t hold this against you! Still, if you would only treble bathe at the start and close of each day, and twice in between, it might do wonders! Also, regarding your weaponry—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("We are ssssso weary... let usss dissscusss sssuch sssmall details in good time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("But of course."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 30,
            y: 18,
          },
