      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "diary",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Vonel, have you seen my personal diary anywhere? It was in the safe keeping of a handmaiden of mine, but she has gone missing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Vonel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("<i>Another</i> of your handmaidens is missing? Since when has she gone missing?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Since I sent her to feed my precious aethenwood tygers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nomeon",
            text: _("<small>(_<i>Oh my...</i>)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("When my diary is found, see that no one looks upon its pages— My diary is very personal, Vonel!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("Of course, m’Lady."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Vonel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 20,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("“The Diary of Lady Salennea”"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("7th day of Greenleaf ...the Sapphire of Ice has yet improved even my own talent for the art of scrying. I have discarded my Orb of Pondering in favor of it. Soon I shall peer into the far side of our Faerie World, which that pretender Lady Dionli claims she fears to descry. She simply has not the talent to do so, though she shall never admit it. How I despise that upstart Lady Dionli, that usurper of my rightful place in the Ka’lian, whose only real talent is the art of..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("28th day of Greenleaf ...now that I have found a powerful ally in Lord Zhangor of the far side, the days of Lady Dionli are nigh over. I need only complete a single small ritual for him, the details of which he shall provide to me after I gather the necessary elements. I list them here so as not to forget: — A slab of cold black granite. — One of my fair young handmaidens. — A twisted metal dagger that menaces with spikes of..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("29th day of Greenleaf ...how was I to know Zhangor’s ritual would involve blood sacrifice?! Oh, if only the wicked “Lady” Dionli had not put me in this unenviable position. Now I shall need another unsalaried novice handmaiden willing to work for “experience”..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("1st day of Leaffall ...still more of these dreadful rituals must be completed before Zhangor can place a curse upon my usurper. Yet if I stop now, everything I have sacrificed— <i>everyone</i> I have sacrificed —shall have been in vain! I owe it to them to continue..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("13th day of Leaffall ...the Ka’lian is growing suspicious because more of my attendants have gone missing than usual. I must vastly intensify my persona. And for future rituals, I shall need new <i>“guests of honor”</i> which are not of elfkind..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("31st day of Leaffall ...those saurians may smell of the swamp they crawl from, but they shall make a worthy sacrifice to Zhangor! I have extended a formal invitation to Arinexis, a saurian ambassador, or what passes for one amongst their primitive and malodorous kind. I shall show this saurian and its entourage every courtesy and tempt them with all the delights of elvish cuisine— seasoned with Shavings of the Yew..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 20,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            experience: "$($unit.experience + 24)",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "$unit.id",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "amount",
            value: 24,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "diplomacy",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 30,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Might I tempt you with some of the finest floral refreshments of elvish cuisine?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Sssalennea, has your Ka’lian ruled to formally apologize to our Sssaurian Empire for sssetting loossse your human minions upon usssss?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("The Ka’lian neither confirms nor denies any involvement. We elves of Wesmere have moved on from this matter and we hope you shall as well!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Oh we will move on, we will..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("<small>(_...as sssoon as we have finished with you here.)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("<small>(_Gorlack, pray position your hunters well and then let usss attack!)</small>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "attack_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("Nay! This is a thing too terrible to foresee. Vonel, save me from these monsters!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Vonel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("I am coming to save you, m’Lady! Dispatch doves to the Ka’lian with word of our peril here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nomeon",
            text: _("Lady Salennea loosed them to the wilds this morning for sake of their well being... I shall bring word myself!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Vonel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "se",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("Nay, I need you here to defend this march until your dying bre—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Nomeon",
            x: 26,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Nomeon",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Vonel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: "2,3,4,5,6",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Salennea%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Salennea",
            text: _("You have slain me, Vonel. Your bias and slander against these gentle giants imbued them with a terrible yet justifiable wrath!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vonel",
            text: _("If only I had listened to you, my Lady... <small><i>my princess</i></small> ... Naaaaaaaay!"),
          },
        ],
      },
